                                    "id": "starter-blk-14",
                                    "block": "faq",
                                    "settings": {},
                                    "data": {
                                        "items": [
                                            {
                                                "question": "Do I need to know PHP to build a theme?",
                                                "answer": "No. A theme is JSON, Blade templates and CSS. Blade is HTML with a few {{ }} tags for printing values."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "question": "Can editors change the colours?",
                                                "answer": "Yes. Every token in tokens.json appears in Pages → Design, where a site can override it without editing the theme."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "question": "Will updating the theme overwrite my pages?",
                                                "answer": "No. Demo content is only added where a page or menu does not exist yet, and a theme update never re-applies it on its own."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "question": "Where do I start?",
                                                "answer": "Copy this theme with tools/new-theme.php, change tokens.json, then work through the guide in docs/."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
